@WMS.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5156

### Crea task (sostituisci targetLocationId con un Id reale da DB)
POST {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/warehousetasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movementKind": 0,
  "priority": 10,
  "targetLocationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "sourceLocationId": null,
  "containerId": null
}

###

GET {{WMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/warehousetasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

###
